                {
                    "text": "To write y = mx + c, get y on its own and put the x term first."
                },
                {
                    "text": "Do the same to both sides. When you divide, divide every term."
                },
                {
                    "text": "To check a point, put its coordinates in. Equal sides mean it's on the line."
                }
